{
  "id": "board_feet_chart_and_calculator",
  "title": "Board Feet Chart and Calculator",
  "description": "Board feet is used as a volume measurement of lumber. Calculate board feet using lumber dimensions and optional pricing information.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Board Feet Calculator\n\nBoard feet is a volume measurement for lumber. One board foot equals one square foot that is one inch thick.\n\n**Formula:** BF = (t × w × L) / 12\n\nWhere:\n- **t** = nominal lumber thickness (inches)\n- **w** = nominal lumber width (inches)\n- **L** = nominal lumber length (feet)\n\nDefault example: 2\" × 4\" × 6' = 4 board feet"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "thickness",
          "label": "Thickness",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "inches",
          "defaultValue": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "width",
          "label": "Width",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "inches",
          "defaultValue": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "length",
          "label": "Length",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "feet",
          "defaultValue": 6
        },
        {
          "id": "price_per_bf",
          "label": "Price per Board Foot",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "$/bf",
          "defaultValue": 0
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "board_feet",
          "label": "Board Feet",
          "formula": "(inputs.thickness * inputs.width * inputs.length) / 12",
          "unit": "bf"
        },
        {
          "id": "total_cost",
          "label": "Total Cost",
          "formula": "((inputs.thickness * inputs.width * inputs.length) / 12) * inputs.price_per_bf",
          "unit": "$",
          "format": "currency"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Dimension",
        "Quick Approximation",
        "Formula"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "1 × 4",
          "Divide length by 3",
          "Length × 1/3"
        ],
        [
          "1 × 6",
          "Divide length by 2",
          "Length × 1/2"
        ],
        [
          "1 × 8",
          "Multiply length by 0.66",
          "Length × 2/3"
        ],
        [
          "1 × 12",
          "Linear length = board feet",
          "Length × 1"
        ],
        [
          "2 × 4",
          "Multiply length by 0.66",
          "Length × 2/3"
        ],
        [
          "2 × 6",
          "Linear length = board feet",
          "Length × 1"
        ],
        [
          "2 × 8",
          "Multiply length by 1.33",
          "Length × 4/3"
        ],
        [
          "2 × 12",
          "Multiply length by 2",
          "Length × 2"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}